  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Healthy herds: AI-powered disease detection for safer meat, stronger markets, and resilient meat value chains in Rwanda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to strengthen Rwanda#s meat value chain by introducing artificial intelligence (AI) solutions to improve animal disease detection at slaughterhouses. By deploying an AI-powered thermal and image recognition system, the initiative will enable early identification of sick animals and enhance compliance with food safety standards.</narrative>
  </description>
